    "directory in the extracted tree, so every path here carries that exact prefix;",
    "the raw header bundles (bcdec, drlibs, qoa) have no outer directory.",
    "The bcdec and drlibs entries record the reviewed path mapping onto the real producer",
    "filenames. The pilot scanned byte-identical header content under the shortened",
    "manual-audit member names (bcdec.h, dr_mp3.h, dr_wav.h); license-prepare instead",
    "preserves the raw vcpkg resource download filename, which carries a git-commit prefix,",
    "so the real member is bcdec-80859ed3....h / dr_libs-dfe83776...-dr_mp3.h. The header",
    "bytes, ScanCode rules, scores and line tuples are unchanged and were verified",
    "byte-identical, so these paths are the real member names the same content reports;",
    "this is a reviewed mapping, not a claim that the original pilot scan itself used them.",
    "A 'curated' finding must match a license_finding_curation exactly; an",
    "'excluded' finding must be matched by a path_exclude glob, both anchored on the",
    "package's verified prefix."
